<title>FRANCE: Cie Bancaire nine month net attrib falls.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire nine month net attrib falls.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     474  vs	     598</p>
<p>    Net						985  vs	     981</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains					  332</p>
<p>    Total loans				  55,218  up	     16 pct</p>
<p>Unit contributions</p>
<p>	UFB Locabail				  157  vs	     76</p>
<p>	Cetelem					 952  vs	    837</p>
<p>	UCB					    -388  vs	   -204</p>
<p>	Klepierre				     132  vs	     85</p>
<p>	Sinvim					 -290  vs	   -378</p>
<p>	Cardiff					 283  vs	    200</p>
<p>NOTE - Cie Bancaire gave the results in a statement. It said its 1996 net result included an exceptional gain of 332 million francs from the sale of UCB Home Loans and the cancellation of future tax provisions. The 1996 Cardiff result includes a 40 million franc capital gain from the sale of seven percent of Fructive.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
